141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (Beekeeping is an important agricultural enterprise that contributes to income generation, employment, crop pollination, and biodiversity conservation. In India, it has emerged as a promising allied activity for farmers due to its low investment requirements and high income potential. However, despite increasing interest in apiculture, many beekeepers face challenges in accessing reliable technical guidance, quality equipment, training facilities, and trustworthy service providers. Information related to beekeeping is often scattered across different sources, making it difficult for farmers to obtain timely assistance.)
/E (Beekeeping is an important agricultural enterprise that contributes to income generation, employment, crop pollination, and biodiversity conservation. In India, it has emerged as a promising allied activity for farmers due to its low investment requirements and high income potential. However, despite increasing interest in apiculture, many beekeepers face challenges in accessing reliable technical guidance, quality equipment, training facilities, and trustworthy service providers. Information related to beekeeping is often scattered across different sources, making it difficult for farmers to obtain timely assistance.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (To address these challenges, Hive to Harvest was developed as a hybrid support ecosystem that integrates both online and offline services for beekeepers. )
/E (To address these challenges, Hive to Harvest was developed as a hybrid support ecosystem that integrates both online and offline services for beekeepers. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (Beekeepers often face difficulties in getting equipment, training, accessing expert consultancy for hive management, and obtaining information about government support and technical services. The absence of a centralized support system results in fragmented information, increased time and effort, and limited access to scientific beekeeping practices. These challenges can reduce productivity and discourage both existing and aspiring beekeepers.)
/E (Beekeepers often face difficulties in getting equipment, training, accessing expert consultancy for hive management, and obtaining information about government support and technical services. The absence of a centralized support system results in fragmented information, increased time and effort, and limited access to scientific beekeeping practices. These challenges can reduce productivity and discourage both existing and aspiring beekeepers.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
