160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 95 0 R
/T (Hive to Harvest is a venture that works directly with farmers and communities at the grassroots level. To extend its reach beyond physical presence, Hive to Harvest also maintains an online platform at hivetoharvest.in, where customers, collaborators, and well-wishers can learn about the venture, follow its work, and get in touch. This pairing of hands-on, local operations with an accessible digital front lets the venture build trust in person while staying open to a wider audience online. Hive to Harvest provides all the services only at a minimal cost of rupees - 100.)
/E (Hive to Harvest is a venture that works directly with farmers and communities at the grassroots level. To extend its reach beyond physical presence, Hive to Harvest also maintains an online platform at hivetoharvest.in, where customers, collaborators, and well-wishers can learn about the venture, follow its work, and get in touch. This pairing of hands-on, local operations with an accessible digital front lets the venture build trust in person while staying open to a wider audience online. Hive to Harvest provides all the services only at a minimal cost of rupees - 100.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
