3044 0 obj
<<
/Title (Beekeeping is an important agricultural enterprise that contributes to income generation, employment, crop pollination, and biodiversity conservation. In India, it has emerged as a promising allied activity for farmers due to its low investment requirements and high income potential. However, despite increasing interest in apiculture, many beekeepers face challenges in accessing reliable technical guidance, quality equipment, training facilities, and trustworthy service providers. Information related to beekeeping is often scattered across different sources, making it difficult for farmers to obtain timely assistance.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2741 0 R
/Next 3045 0 R
>>
endobj
3045 0 obj
<<
/Title (To address these challenges, Hive to Harvest was developed as a hybrid support ecosystem that integrates both online and offline services for beekeepers.)
